  "title": "Spain publishes draft for B2B e-invoicing system",
  "summary": "Spain has published a draft Royal Decree to regulate B2B e-invoicing. The issuer will send a copy of each invoice to the public invoicing solution. Buyers must inform the seller whether or not they accept the invoice and report the date on which they paid it. Adoption deadlines are 12-48 months depending on revenues.",
